    "description": {
      "0": "元素戰技<strong><tooltip ns=char_Valeriy_gen baseKey18=skill>攻勢防禦·堡壘驟進</tooltip></strong>的技能等級提高3級。",
      "1": "至多提升至15級。"
    }
